reward.25=I have a plan for keeping your supplies close at hand. Build a Warehouse Supply Link at the Town Planning Desk and place it near your workbenches. They will draw from our stored goods.
reward.50 = You have earned a look at my packing plans. Your town can now craft Quartermaster Packs. A leatherworker with skill 5 can make them at a tannery.
reward.75 = I made you a copy of our ledger. Open it anywhere inside town to reach the warehouse stores. Keep it close, and let the couriers handle the heavy lifting.
